#ASSERT `Rg 7 (1999 Ed.) Second Schedule: the application fee and the modification or re-test fee in dollars (in that order)` "Radio-communication 10 Low Power Device (where testing by the Authority is required)" EQUALS JUST (LIST 460, 230)
#ASSERT `Rg 7 (1999 Ed.) Second Schedule: the application fee and the modification or re-test fee in dollars (in that order)` "Radio-communication 3 Radio Pager/Two-way Pager" EQUALS JUST (LIST 1300, 650)
#ASSERT `Rg 7 (1999 Ed.) Second Schedule: the application fee and the modification or re-test fee in dollars (in that order)` "Radio-communication 11 Television" EQUALS NOTHING
