#ASSERT `Rg 7 (1999 Ed.) Third Schedule: the test fee and the re-test fee in dollars (in that order)` "Line-based 3 Call Switching/Multiplex System" EQUALS JUST (LIST 500, 250)
#ASSERT `Rg 7 (1999 Ed.) Third Schedule: the test fee and the re-test fee in dollars (in that order)` "Radio-communication 4 Low Power Device" EQUALS JUST (LIST 55, 28)
