#ASSERT NOT (`Rg 7 (1999 Ed.) Fourth Schedule items 1 to 6: the holder of a Dealer's Class Licence is meeting the conditions` TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE)
#ASSERT `Rg 7 (1999 Ed.): the effective day of the version of the Regulations that governs the conduct day, as read on the reading day` (Date 1 12 1999) (Date 1 7 1999) EQUALS JUST (Date 1 12 1999)
#ASSERT `Rg 7 (1999 Ed.): the effective day of the version of the Regulations that governs the conduct day, as read on the reading day` (Date 1 12 1999) (Date 30 6 1999) EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `Rg 7 (1999 Ed.): the effective day of the version of the Regulations that governs the conduct day, as read on the reading day` (Date 30 11 1999) (Date 4 11 2026) EQUALS NOTHING
